  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 3 Stanmore North Precinct 3.pdf\n\nClause 9.3.1 - heritage (heritage): The precinct contains three Heritage C onservation Areas ; being HCA 6 Annanda le \nFarm Heritage Conservation Area, HCA 7 Kingston W est Heritage Conservation Area \nand HCA 8 Cardigan Str eet Heritage Conservation Area.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - heritage (heritage): To prote ct and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and \nencourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect  the identified Heritage Items  within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - height_limit (development_control): To maintain  distinctly single  storey streetscapes that exist within  the precinct.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect groups or runs of buildings which retain their original built form including roof forms, o riginal detailing and finishes.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - other (development_control): To protect  significant streetscape s and/or public domain elements with in the \nprecinct including landscaping,  fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and \nguttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - zoning (land_use_zoning): To preserve the predominantly low density residen tial character of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.3.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of off -street car parking does not \nadversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\n",
